  "story": {
    "day": 38,
    "title": "Kaya's Travel Memories",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a nice Friday evening.",
      "Kaya opened her travel album on Saturday.",
      "She saw a good picture from France.",
      "Next, a delicious recipe from a South Korean chef.",
      "A purple flower picture was from Sydney.",
      "Kaya's mom, a kind woman and office worker, came in.",
      "\"Hello, Kaya. Please show me, okay?\" she said.",
      "They saw Finland in December.",
      "It looked hard to say goodbye to Beijing.",
      "Kaya wanted to meet everyone in Hong Kong.",
      "Maybe in summer, autumn, or February.",
      "Then, they planned a movie theater trip."
    ]
  }
}